5. As monotonic.rb and duration.rb have. The ascii_only fault, resolved only from ~/lib/ruby until 0.10.1, would have failed here.
6. ~ ROADMAP.md: - whether the Gemfile goes. It stays.
7. Six of seven recent gems carry one reading gemspec, statistics.rb alone does not, and the question had taken the outlier for the rule.
